...it's kinda pointless, noja!

24
00:04:16,250 --> 00:04:17,400
たしかに。
True.

25
00:04:17,450 --> 00:04:19,800
うち、うち最強コンビだこら！
We're the strongest duo, ya hear!

26
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,700
あ、あ、あ！
Oh, oh, oh!

27
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,500
ん？
Hm?

28
