そう、思ったから今やってみた。
Yeah, I thought so too, which is why I tried doing it just now.

38
00:04:44,450 --> 00:04:45,600
よく思い出した。
Good thing you remembered.

39
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,800
挨拶もする？
Should we do our introductions too?

40
00:04:47,850 --> 00:04:50,200
あ、たしかに。自己紹介忘れがち。
Oh, right. We always tend to forget introductions.

41
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:51,500
忘れがち。
Always forget.

42
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:53,500
あれね、あの、身長順ね！
You know, in order of height!

43
00:04:53,550 --> 00:04:54,500
身長順ね。
Height order.

44
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:58,200
背の順で自己紹介させていただくのじゃー！
We'll be doing our self-introductions in height order, noja!

45
00:04:58,250 --> 00:04:59,500
あ、じゃこの順に並びます！
Oh, then let's line up in that order!

46
00:04:59,550 --> 00:05:00,008
うーい！
Yep!

47
00:05:00,108 --> 00:05:01,308
あぶのじゃー！
That was close-noja!

48
