確かに。
Fair point.

88
00:06:40,408 --> 00:06:43,008
靴込み。キョーコだけ靴込み。
With shoes on. Only Kyoko included shoes.

89
00:06:43,008 --> 00:06:44,408
靴込みで167。
167 including shoes.

90
00:06:44,408 --> 00:06:47,508
あんま盛っても意味ないシチュエーションなのじゃ、今多分。
It's probably a situation where padding doesn't mean much right now-noja.

91
