で、今日初めてアソビ★まわり隊！だけでマイクラやるわけだけど、
So, today is the first time we're playing Minecraft with just Asobi★Mawari-tai...

94
00:06:59,208 --> 00:07:00,008
そう！
Yeah!

95
00:07:00,008 --> 00:07:01,608
何する？うちら。
What are we gonna do?

96
