Since this is the Asobi★Mawari-tai hideout after all, someone who finds out about it from somewhere... might come. An enemy attack—an enemy attack might come.

2817
02:17:14,016 --> 02:17:14,916
から…
So...

2818
02:17:17,416 --> 02:17:18,316
ん？
Hm?

2819
02:17:21,916 --> 02:17:23,016
のじゃ？
Hm?

2820
