Whaa?! What if we fall into it...

2830
02:17:54,716 --> 02:17:58,016
いや、いいよ、やる？いいよ、いいよ
No, it's fine—wanna do it? It's fine, it's fine!

2831
02:17:58,116 --> 02:17:59,266
